        "A. abandons the Red List to focus on captive breeding only",
        "B. narrows attention exclusively to bacteria while ignoring all fungi",
        "C. expands conservation from plants and animals to fungi and microbes",
        "D. replaces biodiversity targets with goals for large mammal recovery"
